OL,3,GNEWSA'Misguided' plan for travellers
OL,4,Asite rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of travellers hoping to make a
OL,7,Fplot of land their permanent home have
OL,8,Fhad their plans thrown out, with one
OL,9,Fcouncillor describing the idea as
OL,10,F"clearly misguided".
OL,12,FBreckland District Council refused a
OL,13,Fbid to turn the site at Saham Toney,
OL,14,Fnear Watton in Norfolk, into a place
OL,15,Ffor 12 traveller families.
OL,17,FLisa-Jane Jay, who has lived on the
OL,18,Fland for more than 15 years, applied
OL,19,Ffor permission after the council took
OL,20,Fenforcement action in 2025 when 23
OL,21,Fcaravans were moved onto the plot.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
